    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sedekiya ŵamjimucile Nebukadinesa mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya, myoyo Nebukadinesajo ŵayice ku Yelusalemu ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo. Ŵataŵile masakasa gawo kuwusyungulila msindawo, pa lisiku lya likumi lya mwesi, mwesi wa likumi, mcaka camsano ni mcece ca ucimwene wa Sedekiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.21.1+JER.21.2+JER.21.3+JER.21.4+JER.21.5+JER.21.6+JER.21.7+JER.21.8+JER.21.9+JER.21.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yel 21:1-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.34.1+JER.34.2+JER.34.3+JER.34.4+JER.34.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "34:1-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.24.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 24:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo masakasa ga asilikaliwo gawusyungulile msindawo mpaka mcaka ca 11 ca ucimwene wa Sedekiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa lisiku lya msano ni mcece lya mwesi wa mcece, caka cicoco, sala jayice pakusakala, kwakuti ŵandu ŵa mu msindawo nganakola yakulya yiliyose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asilikali ŵa ku Babiloniya ŵapowele mapupa ga msinda wa Yelusalemu. Atamose kuti asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Babiloniya ŵaliji ali awusyungulile msindawo. Mwenye Sedekiya ŵatisile cilo cicoco pamo ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo wosope. Ŵajinjilile litala lya kuja ku mgunda wa mwenye, nipo ŵakopocele pa cipata ca pasikati pa mapupa gaŵili, nipo ŵatilile ku Ciŵata ca Yolodani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.33.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 33:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Babiloniya ŵamkuyiye Mwenye Sedekiya, nipo ŵamkamwile ku malambo gakuŵandicila ku Yeliko. Asilikali ŵakwe wosope ŵabalalikangene nipo ŵamtisile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa ku Babiloniya ali amkamwile Mwenye Sedekiya, ŵajawile najo kwa wa Mwenye Nebukadinesa, ku Libula. Kweleko Nebukadinesa ŵamjimbile magambo Sedekiya, nipo ŵamsimene kuti aleŵile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵawuleje ŵanace ŵa Sedekiya msyene ali mkulola, nipo ŵagakolowele meso ga Sedekiya, ni ŵajawile najo ku Babiloni ali amtaŵile ni unyolo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.12.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Esek 12:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Konasika kwa Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku lya msano ni kaŵili, lya mwesi ŵa msano, mcaka ca 19 ca ucimwene wa Nebukadinesa mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya, Nebusaladani nduna jakwe soni ŵaliji jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali ŵa ngondo, ŵajinjile mu msinda ŵa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵajocice Nyumba ja AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nyumba ja mwenye, ni nyumba syosope sya ŵandu ŵakumanyika ŵa mu Yelusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asilikali ŵakwe ŵagumwile mapupa gosope gakusyungulila msinda wa Yelusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebusaladani ŵajigele ŵandu wosope ŵaŵasigalile mu msindawo kuja nawo ku Babiloniya, pamo ni ŵandu ŵiwatisile mwitala pakwawula ku Babiloniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵalesile ŵandu ŵakulaga mnope kuti alimeje m'migunda ni kusamalila migunda ja mipeleya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa ku Babiloniya ŵala, ŵagumwile ni kusikasanya njalamila sya bulonsi sya m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, pamo ni yipaka ni mipika ja bulonsi, ŵajijigele bulonsijo ni ŵajawile najo ku Babiloni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.15+1KI.7.16+1KI.7.17+1KI.7.18+1KI.7.19+1KI.7.20+1KI.7.21+1KI.7.22+1KI.7.23+1KI.7.24+1KI.7.25+1KI.7.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 7:15-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.3.15+2CH.3.16+2CH.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mbi 3:15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asilikaliwo ŵajigele soni yida yosope ya bulonsi, yakukamulila masengo pa ndaŵi ja mapopelo m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, pamo ni yiwaya yakokolela liwu, mafosholo, mbale syakutaga ubani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni yida yakusimicisya nyali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 7:45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.4.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Mbi 4:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵajigele soni yiwaya yiŵaŵikaga makala gamakolele moto, mbale sya kumisila mesi, ni yida yosope yakupanganyidwa ni golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kapena silifa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usito wa liwunjili lya bulonsi jwakutyocela ku yida yosope yiŵapanganyisye Mwenye Solomoni ya Nyumba ja AMBUJE, waliji wangaŵalanjika, mpela bulonsi jwa njalamila siŵili sila, yipaka, ni mpika wawukulungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulewu wa lucalamila lumo waliji mamita msano ni gatatu, nipo pacanya pakwe paliji pana mtwe wakupanganyidwa ni bulonsi. Msingu wa mtwewo waliji mita jimo ni litika. Mtwewo ŵawusalalisye ni sefa ni maluŵa gakuwoneka mpela yisogosi yosopeyo yakupanganyidwa ni bulonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda akujigalidwa kuja ku Babiloniya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panyuma pakwe, Nebusaladani, jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali jula ŵamkamwile Selaya, jwamkulungwa jwa ŵakutaga mbopesi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni Sefaniya jwaŵili kwa jwamkulungwa jwakutaga mbopesi, pamo ni acakulungwakulungwa ŵatatu ŵa ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ŵamkamwile soni jwamkulungwa juŵalamulilaga asilikali ŵa ngondo mu msindamo, kwisa soni ŵandu msano ŵaŵaliji apungu ŵa mwenye, ŵele ŵasigalile mu msindamo. Ŵamkamwile msilikali juŵaliji kalembela jwa jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali, juŵasonganyaga ŵandu kuti ajawule ku ngondo, ni acakulungwakulungwa ŵane 60, ŵaŵaliji mu msindamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebusaladani ŵajigele ŵandu wosopewo kuja nawo kwa mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya juŵaliji mu msinda wa Libula, mcilambo ca Hamati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kweleko Mwenye Nebukadinesa ŵalamwile kuti ŵakwapule ni kwawulaga ŵanduwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ni muŵatyocesye Ayuda mcilambo ca kumangwawo, ni kuja kutama acikapolo mcilambo ca cilendo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gedaliya bwanamkubwa jwa ku Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebukadinesa mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya ŵamŵisile Gedaliya mwanace jwa Ahikamu ni cisukulu ca Shafani, kuti aŵe bwanamkubwa jwa ku cilambo ca Yuda, kuti ŵaloleleje ŵandu ŵimkanajigalidwa kuja ku ukapolo ku Babiloniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo acakulungwakulungwa ŵa Ciyuda pamo ni asilikali wa ngondo ŵaŵatisile, piŵapikene kuti mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya amŵisile Gedaliya kuti aŵe bwanamkubwa jwa ku Yuda, acakulungwawo pamo ni ŵandu ŵawo wosope, ŵajawile kuja kuwonegana ni Gedaliya ku Misipa. Ŵakulongolelawo mena gawo galiji Ishimaeli mwanace jwa Netaniya, Yohanani mwanace jwa Kaleya, Selaya mwanace jwa Tanihumeti, jwakutyocela ku msinda wa Netofa, ni Yasaniya mwanace jwa Maakati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gedaliya ŵasalile jemanjajo kuti, “Nguŵika cilanga",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " pameso penu kuti, pangali ligongo lyakwajogopela acakulungwakulungwa ŵa ku Babiloniya. Mtame mcilambo muno, nipo mumpikanileje ni kumtumicila mwenye jwa ku Babiloniya, nipo yindu yenu yosope tiyimjendele cenene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mkatikati mwa mwesi wa msano ni kaŵili wa cele cakaco, Ishimaeli mwanace jwa Netaniya ni cisukulu ca Elishama, jwa mwiŵasa lya ucimwene, ŵajawile ku Misipa ni ŵandu ŵane likumi. Ŵamwuleje Gedaliya ni nduna syakwe syosope, nduna sya Ciyuda ni nduna sya ku Babiloniya siŵaliji nasyo ku Misipako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ayitesile yindu yeleyi Ishimaeli, acakulungwakulungwa ŵa ngondo, pamo ni ŵandu wosope ŵaŵaliji ku Misipa, ŵakulaga ni ŵakusicila ŵakwe, ŵatilile ku Iguputo, ligongo ŵajogopaga ŵandu ŵa ku Babiloniya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
